    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49679" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴᾱμα</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remedy,
				medicine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				771c
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεναγμοί, τῶν πόνων
				ἰάματα</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				385
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴασις, ἰάματα τοῦ
