				12.9
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>soothing, pacification</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				10.4
			</span></i>.</div>
